CATEGORIES:YouTube
DESCRIPTION:The mystery of Sutton Hoo deepens! Time Team continues its sec
 ond season in Garden Field\, as the team delve further into the secrets o
 f this extraordinary archaeological landscape\, uncovering new clues and 
 raising even more intriguing questions.\n\nThere’s plenty to get excited 
 about this time around! Stewart Ainsworth joins the team on a fascinating
  mission to discover how the Great Ship\, buried in Mound 1\, could have 
 been transported up the hill to its final resting place. Could the landsc
 ape itself hold the answer? Meanwhile\, on the edge of the Hoo\, the team
  investigate possible pyre sites that could reveal more about the ancient
  rituals and ceremonies carried out here.\n\nAnd the mystery of the extra
 ordinary Bromeswell Bucket only gets more baffling! As conservation and a
 nalysis continue\, the cremated bones and remarkable artefacts found insi
 de seem to be telling very different stories. What was this beautiful and
  precious object really used for\, and who did it belong to? The answers 
 m
